  "headline": "Search Operation Ends At Pongkor Mine With 14 Miners Still Missing",
  "seoTitle": "Search Ends At Illegal Gold Mine In Bogor",
  "metaDescription": "Rescue operations at an illegal gold mine in Pongkor, Bogor, have concluded. 13 miners were confirmed dead while 14 remain missing after a fatal incident.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue efforts at the illegal gold mining site in Pongkor have been officially terminated due to significant safety risks.",
    "A total of 27 individuals were reported trapped by flooding, with 13 confirmed deceased and 14 remaining missing.",
    "Authorities have arrested two suspects and are investigating the operation, where workers were reportedly paid one million rupiah per sack of ore."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Emergency response teams have formally concluded search and rescue operations at an illegal gold mine located in Pongkor, Bogor. The decision to stop the search was made due to the high risk posed to the rescue personnel. The incident, which involved 27 miners becoming trapped by flooding, has resulted in 13 confirmed fatalities, while 14 individuals remain missing. Following the disaster, police have secured the site with police lines and launched an investigation into the operations. Reports indicate that the miners, locally referred to as 'gurandil,' were compensated at a rate of one million rupiah per sack of extracted gold soil. Investigators have since apprehended two suspects in connection with the illegal mining activities, which were described as high-risk and clandestine. Authorities are continuing to probe the incident to identify further details regarding the illicit site's management and operational structure.",
